        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-28T03:20:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A couple&nbsp;errors I may or may not see in this game sadly.</p><p>First possible one being&nbsp;Muninn being out doesn't increase the Fowls damage, only the Matriarch. Couldn't quite tell if you were applying that or not.</p><p>The second is, Omnitron-X has to at least take 1 point of damage for Reactive Plating Subroutine. So attacks have to essentially be 3 damage or higher to trigger it.</p><p>Otherwise sounds like it was a pretty intense game!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
