        "created_at": "2013-05-28T12:07:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>The only thing increasing the fowls damage was the environment, the card just came out around when both Huginn and Muninn were played. &nbsp;Looks like we did play Omnitron's Reactive Plating Subroutine wrong though as the Carrion Fields only had a +1 from Rooftop Combat at the point we destroyed all the birds. &nbsp;I guess we got a little to excited at the prospect of finishing The Matriarch in one shot.</span></p>",
